OL,3,ANato jets down drone that entered
OL,4,ALithuanian airspace
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe origins of the drone are yet to be
OL,7,Fdetermined, a spokesperson for the
OL,8,FLithuanian national crisis management
OL,9,Fcentre said.
